(2126551, 291303, 43774, '<td valign="top">I really love the colours and textures in this. If it were bigger I''d probably give it a 9.</td>', 'I really love the colours and textures in this. If it were bigger I''d probably give it a 9.', '2006-02-06 10:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126562, 291761, 43774, '<td valign="top">Wow, excellent! One of the best.</td>', 'Wow, excellent! One of the best.', '2006-02-06 10:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126564, 291141, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very good</td>', 'Very good', '2006-02-06 10:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126565, 288678, 1041, '<td valign="top">Great title.  Cheese grater?  I like the background lighting a lot, and also that the lighting on the grater is not even.  I wish the grater was a little more shiny, but for that you would''ve had a brand-spanking new one I guess ;)</td>', 'Great title.  Cheese grater?  I like the background lighting a lot, and also that the lighting on the grater is not even.  I wish the grater was a little more shiny, but for that you would''ve had a brand-spanking new one I guess ;)', '2006-02-06 10:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126566, 290797, 43774, '<td valign="top">This is nice</td>', 'This is nice', '2006-02-06 10:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126567, 288753, 43774, '<td valign="top">I like it!</td>', 'I like it!', '2006-02-06 10:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126570, 288203, 43774, '<td valign="top">I really like the photo, I think the black border is overpowering.</td>', 'I really like the photo, I think the black border is overpowering.', '2006-02-06 10:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126572, 291266, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2006-02-06 10:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126576, 288753, 1041, '<td valign="top">Oh yes, this is just beautiful.  I haven''t gotten that far yet in voting, but I think you are going to do well with this one.  It''s truly abstract (to me at least, I have no idea what I''m looking at).  Lots of texture and color, yet I can project something that I recognize into the image.  Congrats on a wonderful shot!</td>', 'Oh yes, this is just beautiful.  I haven''t gotten that far yet in voting, but I think you are going to do well with this one.  It''s truly abstract (to me at least, I have no idea what I''m looking at).  Lots of texture and color, yet I can project something that I recognize into the image.  Congrats on a wonderful shot!', '2006-02-06 10:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126578, 291726, 43774, '<td valign="top">A very cool concept.</td>', 'A very cool concept.', '2006-02-06 10:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126580, 291364, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nice</td>', 'Very nice', '2006-02-06 10:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126587, 290438, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nice</td>', 'Very nice', '2006-02-06 10:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126590, 290508, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nice</td>', 'Very nice', '2006-02-06 10:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126591, 291097, 1041, '<td valign="top">Hm.  Abstract - absolutely.  I have to confess this doesn''t do much for me though.  I think it''s primarily because it looks that you achieved the abstract nature more through post-processing than anything else ... if I saw this in a gallery I would probably not categorize this as photography. I know abstracts are even more than other challenges about taste, so this is just my opinion of course.</td>', 'Hm.  Abstract - absolutely.  I have to confess this doesn''t do much for me though.  I think it''s primarily because it looks that you achieved the abstract nature more through post-processing than anything else ... if I saw this in a gallery I would probably not categorize this as photography. I know abstracts are even more than other challenges about taste, so this is just my opinion of course.', '2006-02-06 10:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126596, 291141, 42638, '<td valign="top">Muy Bien! Wonderful clarity and focus. Interesting subject and composition.</td>', 'Muy Bien! Wonderful clarity and focus. Interesting subject and composition.', '2006-02-06 11:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126599, 291758, 43774, '<td valign="top">Wow I really like this. I''m guessing ice but I love the colours you''ve captured in it.</td>', 'Wow I really like this. I''m guessing ice but I love the colours you''ve captured in it.', '2006-02-06 11:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126600, 291816, 1041, '<td valign="top">Not sure if I would classify this as abstract, since I found it easy to recognize the bananas.  Interesting closeup thought, I like the play of light and shadow, but I have to admit not to be very attracted to the subject matter (I like my bananas almost greenn :)</td>', 'Not sure if I would classify this as abstract, since I found it easy to recognize the bananas.  Interesting closeup thought, I like the play of light and shadow, but I have to admit not to be very attracted to the subject matter (I like my bananas almost greenn :)', '2006-02-06 11:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126601, 291695, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very cool, love the colour.</td>', 'Very cool, love the colour.', '2006-02-06 11:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
