(2126620, 291582, 42638, '<td valign="top">Very nice and consistent. Love how the shapes move your eye.</td>', 'Very nice and consistent. Love how the shapes move your eye.', '2006-02-06 11:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126623, 291500, 42638, '<td valign="top">Fantastic and vivid complimentary colors. Good composition.</td>', 'Fantastic and vivid complimentary colors. Good composition.', '2006-02-06 11:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126625, 290740, 42638, '<td valign="top">Wow, Love the vivid stark colors and the way the bubles accent them. Well done.</td>', 'Wow, Love the vivid stark colors and the way the bubles accent them. Well done.', '2006-02-06 11:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126627, 291765, 42638, '<td valign="top">Wonderful picture. Good colors and shapes leading your eye and giving it motion.</td>', 'Wonderful picture. Good colors and shapes leading your eye and giving it motion.', '2006-02-06 11:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126628, 289406, 1041, '<td valign="top">Definitely abstract.  Interesting juxtaposition to have the square and symmetrical crop yet the center part of the image is not quite aligned.  Still deciding if I like that or not.  May have to come back to look a few more times.</td>', 'Definitely abstract.  Interesting juxtaposition to have the square and symmetrical crop yet the center part of the image is not quite aligned.  Still deciding if I like that or not.  May have to come back to look a few more times.', '2006-02-06 11:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126629, 291418, 42638, '<td valign="top">Wow, Interesting picture. Love the leading lines and good texture.</td>', 'Wow, Interesting picture. Love the leading lines and good texture.', '2006-02-06 11:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126632, 290888, 42638, '<td valign="top">Lovely color and lines. The shadow fo the lines really add movement to the picture</td>', 'Lovely color and lines. The shadow fo the lines really add movement to the picture', '2006-02-06 11:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126633, 290508, 42638, '<td valign="top">Wonderful hues here. Love the green and red lines.</td>', 'Wonderful hues here. Love the green and red lines.', '2006-02-06 11:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126635, 291696, 42638, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. Love the lines and curves. The colors really define it.</td>', 'Nice picture. Love the lines and curves. The colors really define it.', '2006-02-06 11:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126653, 289204, 1041, '<td valign="top">I think this qualifies as an abstract, although your title sorta gives it away, and from the thumbnail it is clearer what I''m looking at, too.  I like the colors, and the graininess, but it seems a bit oversaturated or the light was harsh.  I''d like to see some more tonal variation in some of the blue areas that are currently a bit monochromatic.  Still nice though.</td>', 'I think this qualifies as an abstract, although your title sorta gives it away, and from the thumbnail it is clearer what I''m looking at, too.  I like the colors, and the graininess, but it seems a bit oversaturated or the light was harsh.  I''d like to see some more tonal variation in some of the blue areas that are currently a bit monochromatic.  Still nice though.', '2006-02-06 11:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126659, 291426, 1041, '<td valign="top">Even though clearly recognizable as an office building (or other high-rise) I think this is still an abstract.  Nicely seen.  I like that you photographed a corner of the building so that the lines aren''t all straight, and the contrast between the reflective windows and the other ones (I''m assuming that''s what makes them so different).  I do see some artifacts here, maybe saving at a slightly higher quality setting (to use the full 150k that you are allowed) would take care of that.</td>', 'Even though clearly recognizable as an office building (or other high-rise) I think this is still an abstract.  Nicely seen.  I like that you photographed a corner of the building so that the lines aren''t all straight, and the contrast between the reflective windows and the other ones (I''m assuming that''s what makes them so different).  I do see some artifacts here, maybe saving at a slightly higher quality setting (to use the full 150k that you are allowed) would take care of that.', '2006-02-06 11:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126695, 291848, 50205, '<td valign="top">really great</td>', 'really great', '2006-02-06 11:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126700, 291581, 1041, '<td valign="top">Interesting textures and colors.  Chocolate, icing and ?  At least that''s what it looks like to me :)  I like the colors and the patterns.  Would prefer to see some more focus in the lower left corner and maybe more texture in the upper right, it''s rather bland compared to the rest and makes the image feel a little unbalanced to me.<br/> <br/>I know your frame is very think but since your image doesn''t contain true bright white I find it a little distracting, it also looks wider on the right and bottom then at the left and top.  Did you use an even number of pixels when you expanded the canvas?</td>', 'Interesting textures and colors.  Chocolate, icing and ?  At least that''s what it looks like to me :)  I like the colors and the patterns.  Would prefer to see some more focus in the lower left corner and maybe more texture in the upper right, it''s rather bland compared to the rest and makes the image feel a little unbalanced to me. I know your frame is very think but since your image doesn''t contain true bright white I find it a little distracting, it also looks wider on the right and bottom then at the left and top.  Did you use an even number of pixels when you expanded the canvas?', '2006-02-06 11:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
