(2128740, 291570, 5354, '<td valign="top">This one really caught my eye, very different to the run of the mill shots in this challenge. I particularly like the fact that you have made a definite decision to only show part of the propeller. Leaving the viewer to fill the rest for themselves. Deserves a ribbon in my eyes.</td>', 'This one really caught my eye, very different to the run of the mill shots in this challenge. I particularly like the fact that you have made a definite decision to only show part of the propeller. Leaving the viewer to fill the rest for themselves. Deserves a ribbon in my eyes.', '2006-02-07 02:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128744, 291846, 5354, '<td valign="top">Very graphic. I expected to see more of these in the challenge. This a a very good example of the genre.</td>', 'Very graphic. I expected to see more of these in the challenge. This a a very good example of the genre.', '2006-02-07 02:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128746, 289742, 36999, '<td valign="top">Took me a minute...Glass Bricks?  Way cool image!</td>', 'Took me a minute...Glass Bricks?  Way cool image!', '2006-02-07 02:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128749, 291722, 5354, '<td valign="top">I quite like this image, but the one thing which kills it for me is the focus. You need to have that white swirl in focus, its the one element which the eye recognises as breaking the pattern but being out of focus is ''uncomfortable''.</td>', 'I quite like this image, but the one thing which kills it for me is the focus. You need to have that white swirl in focus, its the one element which the eye recognises as breaking the pattern but being out of focus is ''uncomfortable''.', '2006-02-07 02:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128752, 291578, 36999, '<td valign="top">A duck?  great angle</td>', 'A duck?  great angle', '2006-02-07 02:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128754, 291189, 5354, '<td valign="top">Not sure what I''m looking at, which is what the challenge asked for ;-)<br/>However there doesn''t appear to be any structure to the image, or very little apart from the bold blocks of color. It''s nice but I need more to make it claim those 6 points.</td>', 'Not sure what I''m looking at, which is what the challenge asked for ;-)However there doesn''t appear to be any structure to the image, or very little apart from the bold blocks of color. It''s nice but I need more to make it claim those 6 points.', '2006-02-07 02:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128756, 291131, 5354, '<td valign="top">Nice pastel shades, nice structure, has leading lines, but I can''t get excited about it. There is something missing, it needs another element, but I don''t know what that is.</td>', 'Nice pastel shades, nice structure, has leading lines, but I can''t get excited about it. There is something missing, it needs another element, but I don''t know what that is.', '2006-02-07 02:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128759, 289823, 36999, '<td valign="top">That''s pretty awesome!  beautiful.</td>', 'That''s pretty awesome!  beautiful.', '2006-02-07 02:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128760, 291372, 48560, '<td valign="top">I hope you didnt get any "DNMC" comments on this photo (some people are so stiff on the challenge description). I like this photo, and the B&amp;W choice is very suitable. a tiny complaint is the seemingly blown-out white spot neat the tip (can you see it too?), but maybe it''s just me. 9</td>', 'I hope you didnt get any "DNMC" comments on this photo (some people are so stiff on the challenge description). I like this photo, and the B&W choice is very suitable. a tiny complaint is the seemingly blown-out white spot neat the tip (can you see it too?), but maybe it''s just me. 9', '2006-02-07 02:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128762, 291563, 36999, '<td valign="top">that''s pretty neat!  Water?</td>', 'that''s pretty neat!  Water?', '2006-02-07 02:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128765, 291641, 5354, '<td valign="top">OK - I voted this a 5!<br/>For me the reasons it didn''t get higher are, a) its a little bit of a tired theme, there are lots and lots of examples of this on DPC, which is not a problem except that many of the examples are much more vibrant and cleaner than this. b) the colors are dull and washed out, nothing really jumps off the screen. If you are going to repeat a formula then you have to take it one step further. Its fine to learn and practice, but your scores will reflect that. c) the border doesn''t do much for me, but again thats personal taste.<br/> <br/>All that being negative comment I do think you have had a reasonable attempt, with better lighting you might get a sharper and cleaner image. Boost the saturation in PS and you will be well on the way.<br/> <br/>Hope you don''t think I''m being too brutal</td>', 'OK - I voted this a 5!For me the reasons it didn''t get higher are, a) its a little bit of a tired theme, there are lots and lots of examples of this on DPC, which is not a problem except that many of the examples are much more vibrant and cleaner than this. b) the colors are dull and washed out, nothing really jumps off the screen. If you are going to repeat a formula then you have to take it one step further. Its fine to learn and practice, but your scores will reflect that. c) the border doesn''t do much for me, but again thats personal taste. All that being negative comment I do think you have had a reasonable attempt, with better lighting you might get a sharper and cleaner image. Boost the saturation in PS and you will be well on the way. Hope you don''t think I''m being too brutal', '2006-02-07 03:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128766, 288203, 36999, '<td valign="top">way cool image, border is a bit thick for my taste</td>', 'way cool image, border is a bit thick for my taste', '2006-02-07 03:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
