(2129864, 290529, 24642, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors and the texture in this photograph.<br/>Some points that would IMO really make this pop<br/>A slight ccw rotation to level the line.<br/>Slightly less exposure to capture more powerful shades in the texture.<br/>A square crop cutting of the right part.<br/>-8</td>', 'I really like the colors and the texture in this photograph.Some points that would IMO really make this popA slight ccw rotation to level the line.Slightly less exposure to capture more powerful shades in the texture.A square crop cutting of the right part.-8', '2006-02-07 13:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2129866, 291272, 24642, '<td valign="top">A interesting tense composition.  I really like the soft light.</td>', 'A interesting tense composition.  I really like the soft light.', '2006-02-07 13:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2129947, 291578, 1041, '<td valign="top">Abstract - yes, cause I can''t tell what this is.  The image feels a bit unbalanced to me (too much black on the left), but I do like the colors.</td>', 'Abstract - yes, cause I can''t tell what this is.  The image feels a bit unbalanced to me (too much black on the left), but I do like the colors.', '2006-02-07 14:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
