(2130462, 291266, 24642, '<td valign="top">Very good work.  I really like the shallow DOF, the flow and color.  Perhaps some black at the bottom would add to the balance of the shot.</td>', 'Very good work.  I really like the shallow DOF, the flow and color.  Perhaps some black at the bottom would add to the balance of the shot.', '2006-02-07 17:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
