(2130643, 291806, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good use of lines and light.  I like the mystic feel.</td>', 'Good use of lines and light.  I like the mystic feel.', '2006-02-07 19:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2130680, 289694, 50056, '<td valign="top">I know many people tire of this type of shot (assuming of course, it is a rose) but I dont think that this one should be ignored nor discounted.  It fulfills the challenge quite nicely (could have worked for "Blue II" as well) and it is a beautiful shot! The blues tones are so eyecatching and the composition is so tranquil.  I love it, and good luck!<br/> <br/>anectdote: (LOL) Its a good thing I check for typos, as when i first typed this, the word "shot" was misspelled with an "i"...could have been disastrous/offensive.  LOL</td>', 'I know many people tire of this type of shot (assuming of course, it is a rose) but I dont think that this one should be ignored nor discounted.  It fulfills the challenge quite nicely (could have worked for "Blue II" as well) and it is a beautiful shot! The blues tones are so eyecatching and the composition is so tranquil.  I love it, and good luck! anectdote: (LOL) Its a good thing I check for typos, as when i first typed this, the word "shot" was misspelled with an "i"...could have been disastrous/offensive.  LOL', '2006-02-07 19:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2130687, 291563, 50056, '<td valign="top">Very lovely...good luck</td>', 'Very lovely...good luck', '2006-02-07 19:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2130843, 291581, 35786, '<td valign="top">nail polish maybe? well anyway, I like it! :0) Perhaps the colors would have stood out more if you hadn''t used flash? 7</td>', 'nail polish maybe? well anyway, I like it! :0) Perhaps the colors would have stood out more if you hadn''t used flash? 7', '2006-02-07 20:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2130856, 289206, 35786, '<td valign="top">damn I wish you hadn''t titled it that- I wonder if I coulda figured it out without the hint?!? love the tones :0) 8</td>', 'damn I wish you hadn''t titled it that- I wonder if I coulda figured it out without the hint?!? love the tones :0) 8', '2006-02-07 20:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
