(2132994, 291814, 35602, '<td valign="top">This could have been very intense, but I think the soft focus and the lack of detail really hides the strengths of this photo.</td>', 'This could have been very intense, but I think the soft focus and the lack of detail really hides the strengths of this photo.', '2006-02-08 07:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133012, 289847, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very nice frost composition.  I especially like the pink tone of the light on the upper right.  I think it would have been absolutely stunning if the window sashes were not there.  It could take a bit of work, but you might be able to clone them out, which would make this image excellent as an abstract work of art.</td>', 'Very nice frost composition.  I especially like the pink tone of the light on the upper right.  I think it would have been absolutely stunning if the window sashes were not there.  It could take a bit of work, but you might be able to clone them out, which would make this image excellent as an abstract work of art.', '2006-02-08 07:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133022, 291025, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, but the combination of two tones on this one, split by an obvious line, really hurt this one.  I think sticking with one tone or another would have made the image better.</td>', 'Nice subject, but the combination of two tones on this one, split by an obvious line, really hurt this one.  I think sticking with one tone or another would have made the image better.', '2006-02-08 07:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
