(2133297, 290910, 19178, '<td valign="top">Very elegant abstract.  Great job.  Bumping up.</td>', 'Very elegant abstract.  Great job.  Bumping up.', '2006-02-08 09:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133576, 291814, 36006, '<td valign="top">I am sorry this is not an abstract. This is more of an impressionistic example at best. Also, I wish I could give you a solid critique, but the blur is to much giving away to the out of focus.<br/> <br/>Definition 1= Art that departs significantly from natural appearances. Forms are modified or changed to varying degrees in order to emphasize certain qualities or content. Recognizable references to original appearances may be slight. The term is also used to describe art that is nonrepresentational. <br/> <br/>Definition 2=Not realistic, though the intention is often based on an actual subject, place, or feeling. Pure abstracion can be interpreted as any art in which the depiction of real objects has been entirely discarded and whose aesthetic content is expressed in a formal pattern or structure of shapes, lines and colors. When the representation of real objects is completely absent, such art may be called non-objective.</td>', 'I am sorry this is not an abstract. This is more of an impressionistic example at best. Also, I wish I could give you a solid critique, but the blur is to much giving away to the out of focus. Definition 1= Art that departs significantly from natural appearances. Forms are modified or changed to varying degrees in order to emphasize certain qualities or content. Recognizable references to original appearances may be slight. The term is also used to describe art that is nonrepresentational.  Definition 2=Not realistic, though the intention is often based on an actual subject, place, or feeling. Pure abstracion can be interpreted as any art in which the depiction of real objects has been entirely discarded and whose aesthetic content is expressed in a formal pattern or structure of shapes, lines and colors. When the representation of real objects is completely absent, such art may be called non-objective.', '2006-02-08 11:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133582, 289910, 36006, '<td valign="top">This is not an abstract IMO. It is a landscape, with a reflection. It this was done with a D200, and you double exposed, than IMO, you missed a great opportunity.<br/> <br/>Definition 1= Art that departs significantly from natural appearances. Forms are modified or changed to varying degrees in order to emphasize certain qualities or content. Recognizable references to original appearances may be slight. The term is also used to describe art that is nonrepresentational. <br/> <br/>Definition 2=Not realistic, though the intention is often based on an actual subject, place, or feeling. Pure abstracion can be interpreted as any art in which the depiction of real objects has been entirely discarded and whose aesthetic content is expressed in a formal pattern or structure of shapes, lines and colors. When the representation of real objects is completely absent, such art may be called non-objective. <br/> <br/>Interesting pix, comp ok, color good, yellow line ok for me as an fx, nice lines, nice flow, ok texture, nice light, overall an ok pix but not for this challenge</td>', 'This is not an abstract IMO. It is a landscape, with a reflection. It this was done with a D200, and you double exposed, than IMO, you missed a great opportunity. Definition 1= Art that departs significantly from natural appearances. Forms are modified or changed to varying degrees in order to emphasize certain qualities or content. Recognizable references to original appearances may be slight. The term is also used to describe art that is nonrepresentational.  Definition 2=Not realistic, though the intention is often based on an actual subject, place, or feeling. Pure abstracion can be interpreted as any art in which the depiction of real objects has been entirely discarded and whose aesthetic content is expressed in a formal pattern or structure of shapes, lines and colors. When the representation of real objects is completely absent, such art may be called non-objective.  Interesting pix, comp ok, color good, yellow line ok for me as an fx, nice lines, nice flow, ok texture, nice light, overall an ok pix but not for this challenge', '2006-02-08 11:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133869, 290797, 30861, '<td valign="top">Gonna follow this up with "Silver Apples of the Moon"? Nice work.</td>', 'Gonna follow this up with "Silver Apples of the Moon"? Nice work.', '2006-02-08 12:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133979, 289018, 39988, '<td valign="top">creatively ingenius, instinctive utilization of light</td>', 'creatively ingenius, instinctive utilization of light', '2006-02-08 13:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134375, 291528, 41251, '<td valign="top">Nice shot</td>', 'Nice shot', '2006-02-08 14:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134444, 289645, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very pleasing effect with nice color play. It is often best to avoid any repeated texture but often it is the visual impact that counts. The bottom part is very strong and it loses interest as the color blue takes over into pure texture. A tighter crop, say over the top of the right red oval would have raised the interest more. Of course, this will reduce the color harmony. 7</td>', 'A very pleasing effect with nice color play. It is often best to avoid any repeated texture but often it is the visual impact that counts. The bottom part is very strong and it loses interest as the color blue takes over into pure texture. A tighter crop, say over the top of the right red oval would have raised the interest more. Of course, this will reduce the color harmony. 7', '2006-02-08 15:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134447, 290910, 22734, '<td valign="top">Great play of colors with wonderful shading to give a hand rendition oils effect. very pleasing. 7</td>', 'Great play of colors with wonderful shading to give a hand rendition oils effect. very pleasing. 7', '2006-02-08 15:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134449, 291733, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and meeting the challenge well. 7</td>', 'Very interesting and meeting the challenge well. 7', '2006-02-08 15:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
