(2134760, 291806, 20462, '<td valign="top">I am going to try to predict what it is for each photo:  Yours is ....a comb</td>', 'I am going to try to predict what it is for each photo:  Yours is ....a comb', '2006-02-08 16:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134761, 291629, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice geometric shapes clearly defined by sharp focus. Gentle lighting provides enough light and shadow to model the 3D form but not so much as to blow out detail or look too harsh. Nice limited colour palette. Main weakness for me is a focal point. For an abstract to appeal to me more strongly it doesn''t need to be of anything recognisable but it still requires good composition, possibly a focal point or if not, a pleasing movement if you like for my eye to follow around the frame... The composition here is what is weak for me.</td>', 'Nice geometric shapes clearly defined by sharp focus. Gentle lighting provides enough light and shadow to model the 3D form but not so much as to blow out detail or look too harsh. Nice limited colour palette. Main weakness for me is a focal point. For an abstract to appeal to me more strongly it doesn''t need to be of anything recognisable but it still requires good composition, possibly a focal point or if not, a pleasing movement if you like for my eye to follow around the frame... The composition here is what is weak for me.', '2006-02-08 16:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134763, 291227, 20462, '<td valign="top">I am going to try to predict what it is for each photo:  Yours is ....parchment paper</td>', 'I am going to try to predict what it is for each photo:  Yours is ....parchment paper', '2006-02-08 16:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
