(2134765, 291763, 20462, '<td valign="top">I am going to try to predict what it is for each photo:  Yours is ....car part</td>', 'I am going to try to predict what it is for each photo:  Yours is ....car part', '2006-02-08 16:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134766, 288321, 20462, '<td valign="top">I am going to try to predict what it is for each photo:  Yours is ....washer</td>', 'I am going to try to predict what it is for each photo:  Yours is ....washer', '2006-02-08 16:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134767, 291775, 20462, '<td valign="top">I am going to try to predict what it is for each photo:  Yours is ....sparks flying.</td>', 'I am going to try to predict what it is for each photo:  Yours is ....sparks flying.', '2006-02-08 16:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134768, 290397, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow! First impression as soon as I opened it! This definitely works. There''s little enough detail that I can''t be sure what it is but enough that I can imagine a number of possibilities all of which take me down different paths of thought. I like the sense of movement. I really like that you haven''t ignored composition even though it''s an abstract - I think composition is even more important in an abstract because much of it''s impact is aesthetic. It often doesn''t have a direct message but is just a starting point for the brain to kind of not focus on... In terms of what it conveys to me - some moments I see romance and love, other moments I see faded or lost love and others still I see blood and passion.</td>', 'Wow! First impression as soon as I opened it! This definitely works. There''s little enough detail that I can''t be sure what it is but enough that I can imagine a number of possibilities all of which take me down different paths of thought. I like the sense of movement. I really like that you haven''t ignored composition even though it''s an abstract - I think composition is even more important in an abstract because much of it''s impact is aesthetic. It often doesn''t have a direct message but is just a starting point for the brain to kind of not focus on... In terms of what it conveys to me - some moments I see romance and love, other moments I see faded or lost love and others still I see blood and passion.', '2006-02-08 16:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134784, 290937, 3087, '<td valign="top">Oooh but this is nice too! Great primary colours, great detail and yet softness too. I really like that you''ve not forgotten composition as I do think it''s even more important in an abstract image where so much of the impact is aesthetic. I don''t know what it is I''m looking at so no easy way for this to set me off thinking of different things... some abstracts are more strongly suggestive of concepts, thoughts, dreams, ideas. That said, this is aesthetically pleasing to me, certainly.</td>', 'Oooh but this is nice too! Great primary colours, great detail and yet softness too. I really like that you''ve not forgotten composition as I do think it''s even more important in an abstract image where so much of the impact is aesthetic. I don''t know what it is I''m looking at so no easy way for this to set me off thinking of different things... some abstracts are more strongly suggestive of concepts, thoughts, dreams, ideas. That said, this is aesthetically pleasing to me, certainly.', '2006-02-08 16:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134891, 289939, 40370, '<td valign="top">Definitely a candidate for "What''s that?" Fun color, but would like to see a focal point (some part in focus)??</td>', 'Definitely a candidate for "What''s that?" Fun color, but would like to see a focal point (some part in focus)??', '2006-02-08 17:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134929, 291227, 19178, '<td valign="top">Very nicely presented.</td>', 'Very nicely presented.', '2006-02-08 17:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134933, 291824, 19178, '<td valign="top">Good use of varied textures in this image.</td>', 'Good use of varied textures in this image.', '2006-02-08 17:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135080, 288917, 33068, '<td valign="top">Deocrative marbles?  Beautiful colors?</td>', 'Deocrative marbles?  Beautiful colors?', '2006-02-08 18:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135081, 291696, 47852, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and waves here.  I''ll be interested to come back and find out what exactly it is that I''m looking at once the challenge is over.  Well done!</td>', 'Love the colors and waves here.  I''ll be interested to come back and find out what exactly it is that I''m looking at once the challenge is over.  Well done!', '2006-02-08 18:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135084, 291577, 47852, '<td valign="top">Great object for the challenge and the lighting/coloring really brings out the shape.  Very pleasing to look at.  Well done!</td>', 'Great object for the challenge and the lighting/coloring really brings out the shape.  Very pleasing to look at.  Well done!', '2006-02-08 18:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135089, 291141, 47852, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and curves here.  It seems that the stuff in the background doesn''t really have a purpose here.  Would it have been possible to crop down a tad more so we see more of the colored lines and less of the stuff in the back?  Either way, it''s a great shot.  Very enjoyable to look at.</td>', 'Love the colors and curves here.  It seems that the stuff in the background doesn''t really have a purpose here.  Would it have been possible to crop down a tad more so we see more of the colored lines and less of the stuff in the back?  Either way, it''s a great shot.  Very enjoyable to look at.', '2006-02-08 18:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135090, 290802, 47852, '<td valign="top">Love the simplicity and choice of colors here.  Well done!</td>', 'Love the simplicity and choice of colors here.  Well done!', '2006-02-08 18:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135095, 290902, 47852, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what this is, but I like that I keep looking at it and finding little creatures hidden in the lines and colors.  This is an image I can look at for a while without getting bored.  Well done :)</td>', 'I have no idea what this is, but I like that I keep looking at it and finding little creatures hidden in the lines and colors.  This is an image I can look at for a while without getting bored.  Well done :)', '2006-02-08 18:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135097, 291352, 47852, '<td valign="top">No idea what this is, but it really does look like an eye. Well done!</td>', 'No idea what this is, but it really does look like an eye. Well done!', '2006-02-08 18:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135107, 290508, 47852, '<td valign="top">I like the way you can tell what this is, yet its a whole different viewpoint almost. The only two things that bother me are the little bit of dead leaf at the right and the spider shape in the center.  Once I saw those two things it almost started to detract from the softness and flow of the lines.  Still, I like this one... a 9 :)</td>', 'I like the way you can tell what this is, yet its a whole different viewpoint almost. The only two things that bother me are the little bit of dead leaf at the right and the spider shape in the center.  Once I saw those two things it almost started to detract from the softness and flow of the lines.  Still, I like this one... a 9 :)', '2006-02-08 18:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135129, 291424, 40797, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing abstract photo. There is : wonderful DOF; interesting lines and angels; and dramatic lighting in this image which makes it stand out from the other photos. Teriffic night shot! Good Luck!!!!!!</td>', 'This is an amazing abstract photo. There is : wonderful DOF; interesting lines and angels; and dramatic lighting in this image which makes it stand out from the other photos. Teriffic night shot! Good Luck!!!!!!', '2006-02-08 19:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135141, 290360, 40797, '<td valign="top">This could of been used in the blue challenge too. Nice abstract.</td>', 'This could of been used in the blue challenge too. Nice abstract.', '2006-02-08 19:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135143, 291189, 40797, '<td valign="top">Cool</td>', 'Cool', '2006-02-08 19:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135152, 291525, 40797, '<td valign="top">Very interesting. You could of used this in the blue challenge as well.</td>', 'Very interesting. You could of used this in the blue challenge as well.', '2006-02-08 19:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135191, 291570, 47294, '<td valign="top">Not that abstract as I clearly know what it is but I DON''T CARE!!!  What an amazing photo, love the composition and striking colours!! Well done and good luck. 10</td>', 'Not that abstract as I clearly know what it is but I DON''T CARE!!!  What an amazing photo, love the composition and striking colours!! Well done and good luck. 10', '2006-02-08 19:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135198, 291792, 43991, '<td valign="top">it honestly just looks like you used the liquify filter in photoshop on a picture of a house.  assuming you didnt...my vote is 6<br/> <br/>because the challenge is abstract i think i would have used heavy neat image filters to smooth out the lower left part of this image. good luck</td>', 'it honestly just looks like you used the liquify filter in photoshop on a picture of a house.  assuming you didnt...my vote is 6 because the challenge is abstract i think i would have used heavy neat image filters to smooth out the lower left part of this image. good luck', '2006-02-08 19:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
