(2135370, 290483, 29451, '<td valign="top">Wow, amazing.  I love the texture and sense of depth in this photo.  One of the best in this challenge.</td>', 'Wow, amazing.  I love the texture and sense of depth in this photo.  One of the best in this challenge.', '2006-02-08 20:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
