(2135436, 291065, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great concept and the soft lighting works well, but the over-sharpened edge pieces are very distracting</td>', 'Great concept and the soft lighting works well, but the over-sharpened edge pieces are very distracting', '2006-02-08 21:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135439, 288495, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great "patterns in nature shot" - 7</td>', 'Great "patterns in nature shot" - 7', '2006-02-08 21:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135443, 291568, 30982, '<td valign="top">Enough blue already!  :-)  Like the symmetry.</td>', 'Enough blue already!  :-)  Like the symmetry.', '2006-02-08 21:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135450, 291442, 7485, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. Can''t blame you for the low contrast, that''s the look you''d expect of snow drifts. But the composition has to be strong to carry a pure high-key image, and I don''t find yours strong enough.</td>', 'Interesting idea. Can''t blame you for the low contrast, that''s the look you''d expect of snow drifts. But the composition has to be strong to carry a pure high-key image, and I don''t find yours strong enough.', '2006-02-08 21:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135486, 289703, 30982, '<td valign="top">Twigs in water, rotated 90 degrees?  Makes an interesting image.</td>', 'Twigs in water, rotated 90 degrees?  Makes an interesting image.', '2006-02-08 22:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135493, 291557, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection abstract.  Needs a bit more of a central focus, but I like the patterns.</td>', 'Nice reflection abstract.  Needs a bit more of a central focus, but I like the patterns.', '2006-02-08 22:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135552, 291006, 47852, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and the soft feel.  I wish there was more to it though... with the big white border the actual color area seems small.</td>', 'I love the colors and the soft feel.  I wish there was more to it though... with the big white border the actual color area seems small.', '2006-02-08 22:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135561, 290076, 47852, '<td valign="top">This looks like an inflated air mattress with the extra sharp line at the edge of the first and second curves... but the shapes/color could represent lots of different things on different scales.  Leaves a lot to the imagination.  Nice!</td>', 'This looks like an inflated air mattress with the extra sharp line at the edge of the first and second curves... but the shapes/color could represent lots of different things on different scales.  Leaves a lot to the imagination.  Nice!', '2006-02-08 22:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135592, 291609, 7485, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject and I like the backlight, but I don''t like the compression artifacts. Remember the file can be as big as 150KB, yours is almost half that.</td>', 'Interesting subject and I like the backlight, but I don''t like the compression artifacts. Remember the file can be as big as 150KB, yours is almost half that.', '2006-02-08 22:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135609, 291730, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but the frame over-powers such a small image</td>', 'Great idea, but the frame over-powers such a small image', '2006-02-08 22:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135617, 290814, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great colors! Too bad about the sharpening artifacts</td>', 'Great colors! Too bad about the sharpening artifacts', '2006-02-08 22:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135628, 291827, 50695, '<td valign="top">I know what this is.</td>', 'I know what this is.', '2006-02-08 22:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135639, 289498, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great concept! Lighting works well. Although the soft-focus is clearly part of your artistic interpretation, I think I''d actually prefer a little more detailed skin texture, at least on the dark arm and the breast.</td>', 'Great concept! Lighting works well. Although the soft-focus is clearly part of your artistic interpretation, I think I''d actually prefer a little more detailed skin texture, at least on the dark arm and the breast.', '2006-02-08 22:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135654, 291446, 49337, '<td valign="top">after staring at this for 3 min or so i think i know what this is.  you get a 10 i love the colors the picture is awesome. i have to know if i''m right guessing what this is. it''s a fish tank with tetramin food floating on the water, and an angel fish swimming by?  please let me know. i love this photo it''s a great abstract!!!</td>', 'after staring at this for 3 min or so i think i know what this is.  you get a 10 i love the colors the picture is awesome. i have to know if i''m right guessing what this is. it''s a fish tank with tetramin food floating on the water, and an angel fish swimming by?  please let me know. i love this photo it''s a great abstract!!!', '2006-02-08 23:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135678, 290692, 49337, '<td valign="top">the lines in this photo are excellent, great shot!</td>', 'the lines in this photo are excellent, great shot!', '2006-02-08 23:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135685, 291830, 41675, '<td valign="top">LOL - woody feet! (at least that''s what they appear to be). The highlights seems a bit overdone for my tastes, but interesting entry.</td>', 'LOL - woody feet! (at least that''s what they appear to be). The highlights seems a bit overdone for my tastes, but interesting entry.', '2006-02-08 23:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135695, 291227, 41675, '<td valign="top">Hooray! An abstract entry that I think is worthy of a high score. I like it. Simple, yet intriguing. For me, the large outer white border is a bit too large, but good colors and use of negative space and form. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Hooray! An abstract entry that I think is worthy of a high score. I like it. Simple, yet intriguing. For me, the large outer white border is a bit too large, but good colors and use of negative space and form. Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-02-08 23:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135713, 291189, 41675, '<td valign="top">The white areas are a bit too "hot" and detract from an otherwise interesting image. I do find your abstract composition appealing.</td>', 'The white areas are a bit too "hot" and detract from an otherwise interesting image. I do find your abstract composition appealing.', '2006-02-08 23:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135726, 290693, 41675, '<td valign="top">I''ve read your title twice and at least for me, it''s more abstract than your image :-) I like the left two-thirds of your image. It''s the blurred right third that I find detracting.</td>', 'I''ve read your title twice and at least for me, it''s more abstract than your image :-) I like the left two-thirds of your image. It''s the blurred right third that I find detracting.', '2006-02-08 23:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135730, 291570, 14735, '<td valign="top">I can tell what it is, but I still think it is a good abstract. Great colors and angle. 10</td>', 'I can tell what it is, but I still think it is a good abstract. Great colors and angle. 10', '2006-02-08 23:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135732, 291629, 41675, '<td valign="top">Ooh - very cool image. I like the colors and structure of your photo. Nicely done.</td>', 'Ooh - very cool image. I like the colors and structure of your photo. Nicely done.', '2006-02-08 23:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135734, 291500, 14735, '<td valign="top">Sometimes simple is best. The colors work well together, good crop.</td>', 'Sometimes simple is best. The colors work well together, good crop.', '2006-02-08 23:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135737, 291141, 14735, '<td valign="top">I like the colors with the dark background. Very pleasing to the eye</td>', 'I like the colors with the dark background. Very pleasing to the eye', '2006-02-08 23:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135738, 290790, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the optical illusion of motion when looking at your image. I don''t care for the blurred outer ring, but the blue lines are very cool.</td>', 'I like the optical illusion of motion when looking at your image. I don''t care for the blurred outer ring, but the blue lines are very cool.', '2006-02-08 23:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135739, 291696, 14735, '<td valign="top">This shot seems to flow well without being too busy. Nice job.</td>', 'This shot seems to flow well without being too busy. Nice job.', '2006-02-08 23:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135741, 288917, 14735, '<td valign="top">Good dark colors and a nice soft feel about it.</td>', 'Good dark colors and a nice soft feel about it.', '2006-02-08 23:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135761, 291780, 10848, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image! Wonderful clarity and detail, the lighting in outstanding! 10</td>', 'Beautiful image! Wonderful clarity and detail, the lighting in outstanding! 10', '2006-02-08 23:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135763, 291554, 10848, '<td valign="top">Wow this is great! The colors really add to this image IMO, great shot! 10</td>', 'Wow this is great! The colors really add to this image IMO, great shot! 10', '2006-02-08 23:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
