(2136069, 291021, 48545, '<td valign="top">great abstract, the dark / light curves pull you into the image.  When you get to the centre, it brings out a nice 3D effect.  I reckon I know what this is, however I''m not going to mention it here, for fear of sounding daft.  The only critique I have is that the transition between blur and focus is sometimes a little hard (in the bottom left quarter of the photo.</td>', 'great abstract, the dark / light curves pull you into the image.  When you get to the centre, it brings out a nice 3D effect.  I reckon I know what this is, however I''m not going to mention it here, for fear of sounding daft.  The only critique I have is that the transition between blur and focus is sometimes a little hard (in the bottom left quarter of the photo.', '2006-02-09 03:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
