(2136441, 291571, 31885, '<td valign="top">I don''t know whether it will do well as an abstract, but I like it a lot. Nice tones and sense of movement.</td>', 'I don''t know whether it will do well as an abstract, but I like it a lot. Nice tones and sense of movement.', '2006-02-09 09:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2136445, 291413, 31885, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. I think it may have been even better with ful DOF.</td>', 'Nice capture. I think it may have been even better with ful DOF.', '2006-02-09 09:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2136450, 290066, 31885, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea. I''ve heard that "receding black" is very difficult to achieve. I think it may have been even better if you could somehow make it look as though the circle was in the foreground and the black in the background.</td>', 'Very creative idea. I''ve heard that "receding black" is very difficult to achieve. I think it may have been even better if you could somehow make it look as though the circle was in the foreground and the black in the background.', '2006-02-09 09:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2136454, 291580, 1041, '<td valign="top">I can recognize what this is but I think this still qualifies for an abstract :)  I like the highlights on some of the metal although overall, this is a bit dark on my monitor.</td>', 'I can recognize what this is but I think this still qualifies for an abstract :)  I like the highlights on some of the metal although overall, this is a bit dark on my monitor.', '2006-02-09 09:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2136502, 291251, 1041, '<td valign="top">Definitely an abstract, I have absolultely no clue what I''m looking at :)  Nice symmetry and color hues and texture.  Now, I''m not saying it is, but it looks to me as if a photoshop filter has been applied rather strongly.  I guess I''ll just check this out again when the results are posted.  :)</td>', 'Definitely an abstract, I have absolultely no clue what I''m looking at :)  Nice symmetry and color hues and texture.  Now, I''m not saying it is, but it looks to me as if a photoshop filter has been applied rather strongly.  I guess I''ll just check this out again when the results are posted.  :)', '2006-02-09 09:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2136506, 291507, 1041, '<td valign="top">I can sort of see what I''m looking at (a vent cover or similar), but I think it''s still an abstract.  The shallow DOF, and the only thing being in focus being all the way to the left of the image sort of pull my eye over to only that side, I wonder if I would like a different focal point or more DOF better.</td>', 'I can sort of see what I''m looking at (a vent cover or similar), but I think it''s still an abstract.  The shallow DOF, and the only thing being in focus being all the way to the left of the image sort of pull my eye over to only that side, I wonder if I would like a different focal point or more DOF better.', '2006-02-09 09:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2136517, 289818, 48890, '<td valign="top">It would be interesting to know how this was shot. :)</td>', 'It would be interesting to know how this was shot. :)', '2006-02-09 09:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
