(2136855, 291528, 30982, '<td valign="top">Abstract?  Yes, more or less.  The centered composition may hurt this a bit - if off center it might be "more abstract".</td>', 'Abstract?  Yes, more or less.  The centered composition may hurt this a bit - if off center it might be "more abstract".', '2006-02-09 12:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
