(2136859, 288472, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very good technically.</td>', 'Very good technically.', '2006-02-09 12:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2136860, 291184, 30982, '<td valign="top">A bit tired of drips/drops but nice background for this one.</td>', 'A bit tired of drips/drops but nice background for this one.', '2006-02-09 12:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2136862, 291218, 30982, '<td valign="top">Abstract?  Yes, and good use of color.</td>', 'Abstract?  Yes, and good use of color.', '2006-02-09 12:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2136863, 290671, 30982, '<td valign="top">While maybe not what some would see as "abstract", it does show a "different perspective" on a common element.  Might like to see the tip of the upper right bulb for a bit more balance.</td>', 'While maybe not what some would see as "abstract", it does show a "different perspective" on a common element.  Might like to see the tip of the upper right bulb for a bit more balance.', '2006-02-09 12:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2136864, 291493, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very visually appealing, due to texture and color.  Lighting is excellent.</td>', 'Very visually appealing, due to texture and color.  Lighting is excellent.', '2006-02-09 12:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2136867, 291780, 30982, '<td valign="top">Even though it''s blue  (I''m a bit tired of "blue"), I do like this - nice balanced composition.</td>', 'Even though it''s blue  (I''m a bit tired of "blue"), I do like this - nice balanced composition.', '2006-02-09 12:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2137002, 291827, 43682, '<td valign="top">abstract?</td>', 'abstract?', '2006-02-09 13:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2137062, 291582, 1041, '<td valign="top">Straws?  Great idea for this.  Abstract even though I can tell what this is.  Couple of things that - if changed - would improve this one for me: More DOF (so the bottom is in focus, less reflections (not an easy one, I know), crop a bit tighter on the top right corner.</td>', 'Straws?  Great idea for this.  Abstract even though I can tell what this is.  Couple of things that - if changed - would improve this one for me: More DOF (so the bottom is in focus, less reflections (not an easy one, I know), crop a bit tighter on the top right corner.', '2006-02-09 14:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2137065, 291266, 1041, '<td valign="top">Oh, yes, beautiful!  Yes, I think I can tell what this is (I was considering shooting paper, too, but got sidetracked with another idea), but it''s clearly still an abstract in my mind.  Love the composition, the vibrant red against the black background, the DOF, I think you got it nailed here.</td>', 'Oh, yes, beautiful!  Yes, I think I can tell what this is (I was considering shooting paper, too, but got sidetracked with another idea), but it''s clearly still an abstract in my mind.  Love the composition, the vibrant red against the black background, the DOF, I think you got it nailed here.', '2006-02-09 14:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2137283, 291216, 1041, '<td valign="top">Not really an abstract in my book.  I''ve been accepting images to be abstracts even if I recognized the subject as long as it''s not quite obvious or the angle obscures what it is.  I don''t feel that''s the case with your image, I still primarily see an office.  Of course this is just my opinion, others may disagree.  As a concept this is nice, I like office building / sky reflections.</td>', 'Not really an abstract in my book.  I''ve been accepting images to be abstracts even if I recognized the subject as long as it''s not quite obvious or the angle obscures what it is.  I don''t feel that''s the case with your image, I still primarily see an office.  Of course this is just my opinion, others may disagree.  As a concept this is nice, I like office building / sky reflections.', '2006-02-09 15:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2137289, 291822, 1041, '<td valign="top">This is definitely an abstract, since I have no idea what I''m looking at.  Having said that, if I''d seen this in a gallery, my first thought would not have been that this is a photo.  It may not be, but it looks heavily changed in post-processing to me.  I like the curves and the colors, am in two minds about the grain, will have to come back and look again for that.</td>', 'This is definitely an abstract, since I have no idea what I''m looking at.  Having said that, if I''d seen this in a gallery, my first thought would not have been that this is a photo.  It may not be, but it looks heavily changed in post-processing to me.  I like the curves and the colors, am in two minds about the grain, will have to come back and look again for that.', '2006-02-09 15:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2137392, 291251, 41251, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot</td>', 'Very nice shot', '2006-02-09 16:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
