(2139774, 291827, 48545, '<td valign="top">This really isn''t abstract photography, a lot of people appear to have confused abstract with macro, unfortunately this doesn''t meet either.  In terms of the photo, it is pretty good, the out of focus glasses aren''t exactly pleasing to the eye, however it does make you think about the photo</td>', 'This really isn''t abstract photography, a lot of people appear to have confused abstract with macro, unfortunately this doesn''t meet either.  In terms of the photo, it is pretty good, the out of focus glasses aren''t exactly pleasing to the eye, however it does make you think about the photo', '2006-02-10 09:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
