(2140802, 290544, 36006, '<td valign="top">I am not convinced of abstract. I am convinced that it is impressionistic, even witht the motion/ blur fx. Excellent movement, I like the "ghostly" lines, nice flow, good comp, interesting color, overall an interesting piece.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I am not convinced of abstract. I am convinced that it is impressionistic, even witht the motion/ blur fx. Excellent movement, I like the "ghostly" lines, nice flow, good comp, interesting color, overall an interesting piece. ', '2006-02-10 16:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2140806, 291570, 36006, '<td valign="top">If the blades were cropped out, I would of been convinced. But, as it is, I do not see an abstract, I see a tight shot.<br/> <br/>Definition 1= Art that departs significantly from natural appearances. Forms are modified or changed to varying degrees in order to emphasize certain qualities or content. Recognizable references to original appearances may be slight. The term is also used to describe art that is nonrepresentational. <br/> <br/>Definition 2=Not realistic, though the intention is often based on an actual subject, place, or feeling. Pure abstracion can be interpreted as any art in which the depiction of real objects has been entirely discarded and whose aesthetic content is expressed in a formal pattern or structure of shapes, lines and colors. When the representation of real objects is completely absent, such art may be called non-objective. <br/> <br/>I like the color, excellent comp, good lines, great light, good texture, good flow, overall a great pix, but not for this challenge</td>', 'If the blades were cropped out, I would of been convinced. But, as it is, I do not see an abstract, I see a tight shot. Definition 1= Art that departs significantly from natural appearances. Forms are modified or changed to varying degrees in order to emphasize certain qualities or content. Recognizable references to original appearances may be slight. The term is also used to describe art that is nonrepresentational.  Definition 2=Not realistic, though the intention is often based on an actual subject, place, or feeling. Pure abstracion can be interpreted as any art in which the depiction of real objects has been entirely discarded and whose aesthetic content is expressed in a formal pattern or structure of shapes, lines and colors. When the representation of real objects is completely absent, such art may be called non-objective.  I like the color, excellent comp, good lines, great light, good texture, good flow, overall a great pix, but not for this challenge', '2006-02-10 16:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2140809, 291448, 36006, '<td valign="top">I am sorry, but this is not an abstract, IMO. It is a close up.<br/> <br/>Definition 1= Art that departs significantly from natural appearances. Forms are modified or changed to varying degrees in order to emphasize certain qualities or content. Recognizable references to original appearances may be slight. The term is also used to describe art that is nonrepresentational. <br/> <br/>Definition 2=Not realistic, though the intention is often based on an actual subject, place, or feeling. Pure abstracion can be interpreted as any art in which the depiction of real objects has been entirely discarded and whose aesthetic content is expressed in a formal pattern or structure of shapes, lines and colors. When the representation of real objects is completely absent, such art may be called non-objective. <br/> <br/>Interesting shot,interesting comp, nice lines, light ok, I know what you were trying with the center FP, but maybe go into macro would of been better for this challenge, nice texture, nice flow, I like the color, interesting angle, overall could of been a contender</td>', 'I am sorry, but this is not an abstract, IMO. It is a close up. Definition 1= Art that departs significantly from natural appearances. Forms are modified or changed to varying degrees in order to emphasize certain qualities or content. Recognizable references to original appearances may be slight. The term is also used to describe art that is nonrepresentational.  Definition 2=Not realistic, though the intention is often based on an actual subject, place, or feeling. Pure abstracion can be interpreted as any art in which the depiction of real objects has been entirely discarded and whose aesthetic content is expressed in a formal pattern or structure of shapes, lines and colors. When the representation of real objects is completely absent, such art may be called non-objective.  Interesting shot,interesting comp, nice lines, light ok, I know what you were trying with the center FP, but maybe go into macro would of been better for this challenge, nice texture, nice flow, I like the color, interesting angle, overall could of been a contender', '2006-02-10 16:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2140812, 289498, 36006, '<td valign="top">I am sorry, but, this is not an abstract, IMO. It is a tight shot.<br/> <br/>Definition 1= Art that departs significantly from natural appearances. Forms are modified or changed to varying degrees in order to emphasize certain qualities or content. Recognizable references to original appearances may be slight. The term is also used to describe art that is nonrepresentational. <br/> <br/>Definition 2=Not realistic, though the intention is often based on an actual subject, place, or feeling. Pure abstracion can be interpreted as any art in which the depiction of real objects has been entirely discarded and whose aesthetic content is expressed in a formal pattern or structure of shapes, lines and colors. When the representation of real objects is completely absent, such art may be called non-objective. <br/> <br/>Interesting comp, great light, good lines, nice flow, a little noisy,a bit soft, B&amp;w great, nice flow, overall a very nice pix but not for this challenge</td>', 'I am sorry, but, this is not an abstract, IMO. It is a tight shot. Definition 1= Art that departs significantly from natural appearances. Forms are modified or changed to varying degrees in order to emphasize certain qualities or content. Recognizable references to original appearances may be slight. The term is also used to describe art that is nonrepresentational.  Definition 2=Not realistic, though the intention is often based on an actual subject, place, or feeling. Pure abstracion can be interpreted as any art in which the depiction of real objects has been entirely discarded and whose aesthetic content is expressed in a formal pattern or structure of shapes, lines and colors. When the representation of real objects is completely absent, such art may be called non-objective.  Interesting comp, great light, good lines, nice flow, a little noisy,a bit soft, B&w great, nice flow, overall a very nice pix but not for this challenge', '2006-02-10 16:53:26.000000', NULL, 1);
