(2140813, 291340, 36006, '<td valign="top">I am not convinced of abstract. I am convinced of impressionism.<br/> <br/>Intersesting pix, good lines, they lead my eye, therefore excellent movement, color nice, light ok, comp good, good use of AV, dof ok, overall a nice pix, but not for this challenge.</td>', 'I am not convinced of abstract. I am convinced of impressionism. Intersesting pix, good lines, they lead my eye, therefore excellent movement, color nice, light ok, comp good, good use of AV, dof ok, overall a nice pix, but not for this challenge.', '2006-02-10 16:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2141022, 291424, 43565, '<td valign="top">This really messes with my mind!  My first thought was balconies and railings, but I really have no idea!</td>', 'This really messes with my mind!  My first thought was balconies and railings, but I really have no idea!', '2006-02-10 18:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2141025, 291418, 43565, '<td valign="top">Well, "If it is recognizable as an object - it is not an abstract."  It looks like a staircase, but I''m hoping it isn''t.  I love the colors, textures, and shape.  An 8 for now, but I won''t be happy if it is a staircase.</td>', 'Well, "If it is recognizable as an object - it is not an abstract."  It looks like a staircase, but I''m hoping it isn''t.  I love the colors, textures, and shape.  An 8 for now, but I won''t be happy if it is a staircase.', '2006-02-10 18:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
