(2142254, 288626, 10402, '<td valign="top">Such a nice form and great color! It doesn''t need to be out of focus to be abstract, and I find the lack of focus distracting.</td>', 'Such a nice form and great color! It doesn''t need to be out of focus to be abstract, and I find the lack of focus distracting.', '2006-02-11 09:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2142331, 291537, 35602, '<td valign="top">The use of cubism was exceptional on this image.  The background, being two colors and cut in half, really take away from the beauty of the geometrical foreground.  It would have had more impact if you simplified the composition by unifying the background.</td>', 'The use of cubism was exceptional on this image.  The background, being two colors and cut in half, really take away from the beauty of the geometrical foreground.  It would have had more impact if you simplified the composition by unifying the background.', '2006-02-11 10:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2142345, 291593, 35602, '<td valign="top">I like the use of multi-image lens.  The subject did not seem to do well with this lens, though.  The detail is very good, but as an abstract I think a better, more obscure subject would have been better.</td>', 'I like the use of multi-image lens.  The subject did not seem to do well with this lens, though.  The detail is very good, but as an abstract I think a better, more obscure subject would have been better.', '2006-02-11 10:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2142350, 291808, 35602, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like an old woodcut.  The technique was really interesting.  I like the way the pattern of the "waves" follows the shape the closer it gets to the tip.  Nice job.  Could use a bit more contrast, though.</td>', 'Almost looks like an old woodcut.  The technique was really interesting.  I like the way the pattern of the "waves" follows the shape the closer it gets to the tip.  Nice job.  Could use a bit more contrast, though.', '2006-02-11 10:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2142355, 290399, 35602, '<td valign="top">Really nice abstract.  It is so beautiful.</td>', 'Really nice abstract.  It is so beautiful.', '2006-02-11 10:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2142374, 291608, 35602, '<td valign="top">What a cool idea.  The use of such a simple object, to make an entire abstract was marvelous.  Like this one alot for its simplicity.  The only thing that this could have used was perhaps a filter to take away some of the noise.</td>', 'What a cool idea.  The use of such a simple object, to make an entire abstract was marvelous.  Like this one alot for its simplicity.  The only thing that this could have used was perhaps a filter to take away some of the noise.', '2006-02-11 11:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
