(2142439, 291537, 24454, '<td valign="top">This photo is WONDERFUL!!   That "leg" looks like it is sticking right out of the picture -- so 3-dimensional looking.   I love the deep rich colors and the different shades that the lighting makes the blues.   It is as crystal clear as you could get.    This is most definitely one of my favorites in this challenge!   Good Luck!!</td>', 'This photo is WONDERFUL!!   That "leg" looks like it is sticking right out of the picture -- so 3-dimensional looking.   I love the deep rich colors and the different shades that the lighting makes the blues.   It is as crystal clear as you could get.    This is most definitely one of my favorites in this challenge!   Good Luck!!', '2006-02-11 11:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2142471, 291045, 44611, '<td valign="top">I love the blues here and the whole fluid feeling.  However, it would have been even better with the background cropped out.</td>', 'I love the blues here and the whole fluid feeling.  However, it would have been even better with the background cropped out.', '2006-02-11 11:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
