(2142509, 291557, 44611, '<td valign="top">This is great, but I think would have benefited from a tighter crop at the top and lhs.</td>', 'This is great, but I think would have benefited from a tighter crop at the top and lhs.', '2006-02-11 12:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
