(2142522, 291837, 24454, '<td valign="top">There''s something about this that just keeps me looking at it.   And the more I look at it, the more I love it.   It is in fact, wonderfully abstract, but you can''t miss the joy and freedom on the model''s face and demeanor.  It''s an abstract shot that makes me happy to look at it.  Good luck.</td>', 'There''s something about this that just keeps me looking at it.   And the more I look at it, the more I love it.   It is in fact, wonderfully abstract, but you can''t miss the joy and freedom on the model''s face and demeanor.  It''s an abstract shot that makes me happy to look at it.  Good luck.', '2006-02-11 12:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
