(2143315, 291570, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - Very nice.  Criticism (somewhat difficult with abstracts); perhaps not quite so dark, not sure.  Maybe also needs the slightest nudge up on the right to get it dead straight, again, not sure.  Up to 9 from 8, also because harder to do abstracts that aren''t macros in my opinion.</td>', '9 - Very nice.  Criticism (somewhat difficult with abstracts); perhaps not quite so dark, not sure.  Maybe also needs the slightest nudge up on the right to get it dead straight, again, not sure.  Up to 9 from 8, also because harder to do abstracts that aren''t macros in my opinion.', '2006-02-11 20:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
