(2143352, 290438, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good perspective which also creates a good visual illusion.  Seemingly good symmetry.  Nice coloring.  Criticism (somewhat difficult with abstracts); perhaps the coloring tweaked up more, the line behind in the center detracts slightly, but minor.  Perhaps also a little softer overall - thought not sure on that.</td>', '8 - Good perspective which also creates a good visual illusion.  Seemingly good symmetry.  Nice coloring.  Criticism (somewhat difficult with abstracts); perhaps the coloring tweaked up more, the line behind in the center detracts slightly, but minor.  Perhaps also a little softer overall - thought not sure on that.', '2006-02-11 20:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2143353, 290902, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - Very nice.  Criticism (somewhat difficult with abstracts); maybe just the colors tweaked up a bit more.  Difficult, but also maybe a little more definition in the swirls/shapes/lines etc.  Up to 9 from 8.</td>', '9 - Very nice.  Criticism (somewhat difficult with abstracts); maybe just the colors tweaked up a bit more.  Difficult, but also maybe a little more definition in the swirls/shapes/lines etc.  Up to 9 from 8.', '2006-02-11 20:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
