(2144004, 291641, 48545, '<td valign="top">Nice bright colours, surprisingly the wacky border fits the image nicely.  However, as this is an abstract challenge, the fact it is a load of pens in a container takes away from the image slightly.  There are also quite a few JPEG artifacts dotted around the edges as well.  Is this because the image has been saved again and again as a JPEG?</td>', 'Nice bright colours, surprisingly the wacky border fits the image nicely.  However, as this is an abstract challenge, the fact it is a load of pens in a container takes away from the image slightly.  There are also quite a few JPEG artifacts dotted around the edges as well.  Is this because the image has been saved again and again as a JPEG?', '2006-02-12 04:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
