(2145693, 291113, 50695, '<td valign="top">10. There''s something painterly about this, very 20th century. I realize there is a "representational" image used, but it''s not used to "represent." It becomes pure image, pure abstraction. This picture hides and seems just about to reveal. It''s hypnotic.</td>', '10. There''s something painterly about this, very 20th century. I realize there is a "representational" image used, but it''s not used to "represent." It becomes pure image, pure abstraction. This picture hides and seems just about to reveal. It''s hypnotic.', '2006-02-12 23:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2145697, 291808, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love how this looks like a pen and ink print. I know this is very subtle, but I would have preferred not seeing the shadows of these "waves." Still, a lovely, magical shot.</td>', 'I love how this looks like a pen and ink print. I know this is very subtle, but I would have preferred not seeing the shadows of these "waves." Still, a lovely, magical shot.', '2006-02-12 23:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
