(2148934, 289673, 40370, '<td valign="top">Yes, wait no, I''ve never done the microwave thing before, but yes I like your outake with a wider color range and unusual tilt better. I gave you a 6 for the record. Disliked your title because you were semi-quoting the challenge details. I resort to the dictionary for ideas regarding titles. Congrats on your 27th place in a most tough challenge.</td>', 'Yes, wait no, I''ve never done the microwave thing before, but yes I like your outake with a wider color range and unusual tilt better. I gave you a 6 for the record. Disliked your title because you were semi-quoting the challenge details. I resort to the dictionary for ideas regarding titles. Congrats on your 27th place in a most tough challenge.', '2006-02-14 00:01:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(2149229, 291266, 5728, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your comments and votes, it is fun being back again :) All this is is a a bunch of about 20 sheets of red A4. I put a paper clip to hold one end and then pushed the other end inwards a little to form some wave and put a paper clip at that end so it would stay in that form. Set up two softboxes in varios positions and experimented by moving the lighting and changing the aperture. Post processing only included cropping, curves, color balance, and a little blurring/sharpening.</td>', 'Thanks for all your comments and votes, it is fun being back again :) All this is is a a bunch of about 20 sheets of red A4. I put a paper clip to hold one end and then pushed the other end inwards a little to form some wave and put a paper clip at that end so it would stay in that form. Set up two softboxes in varios positions and experimented by moving the lighting and changing the aperture. Post processing only included cropping, curves, color balance, and a little blurring/sharpening.', '2006-02-14 02:39:57.000000', NULL, 0),
