(2162635, 288753, 19978, '<td valign="top">An amazing score for a shot with so few comments! You really  had them stumped. I didn''t get to vote on this challenge but stumbled on your shot in the astro gallery. Quite nice! I''d like to see a "normal" shot of this light. Kudos to you for finding this opportunity!</td>', 'An amazing score for a shot with so few comments! You really  had them stumped. I didn''t get to vote on this challenge but stumbled on your shot in the astro gallery. Quite nice! I''d like to see a "normal" shot of this light. Kudos to you for finding this opportunity!', '2006-02-19 00:35:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(2162685, 291794, 27767, '<td valign="top">At first I thought it was a thigh as the long part of the 7, but was working on what the top was.  I love nudes that move into abstraction and really maintain the viewers attention.</td>', 'At first I thought it was a thigh as the long part of the 7, but was working on what the top was.  I love nudes that move into abstraction and really maintain the viewers attention.', '2006-02-19 00:53:09.000000', NULL, 0),
