(2164024, 291844, 332, '<td valign="top">Critique Club:<br/>Not sure what this is. The shape is good and composition. It looks like it is wet. I think the lighting could be better. A strong backlight or something like that. Good luck in future challanges :) You''ve got some great wildlife shots. Keep it up.</td>', 'Critique Club:Not sure what this is. The shape is good and composition. It looks like it is wet. I think the lighting could be better. A strong backlight or something like that. Good luck in future challanges :) You''ve got some great wildlife shots. Keep it up.', '2006-02-19 20:16:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(2164330, 290542, 42638, '<td valign="top"><b>Greetings from the Critique Club</b> <br/> <br/>The first thing that I see when I look at this is the nice soft colors against some good even curves. Wonderful color here. Great job with the background, I wouldn''t have guessed it was a glass vase or wrapping paper, Unique ideas leading to a nice composition. I like how the glass ripples are overtaking and providing nice movement in 3/4 of the frame, the slight distortion of the background is wonderful. The whiter streak on the right is a bit distracting, maybe a light reflection. Very nice abstract and definately has the "Wow" feel but its just not strong enough. Maybe bringing the contrast and saturation up a bit would really strengthen this. Overall, Its a good picture, fits the challenge perfectly and a nice strong title. Well done.</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club  The first thing that I see when I look at this is the nice soft colors against some good even curves. Wonderful color here. Great job with the background, I wouldn''t have guessed it was a glass vase or wrapping paper, Unique ideas leading to a nice composition. I like how the glass ripples are overtaking and providing nice movement in 3/4 of the frame, the slight distortion of the background is wonderful. The whiter streak on the right is a bit distracting, maybe a light reflection. Very nice abstract and definately has the "Wow" feel but its just not strong enough. Maybe bringing the contrast and saturation up a bit would really strengthen this. Overall, Its a good picture, fits the challenge perfectly and a nice strong title. Well done.', '2006-02-19 22:41:51.000000', NULL, 0),
