(2296794, 291230, 12253, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe I didn''t comment on this (I did vote on this challenge, and this one got a 9 from me).  It''s simply wonderful.  Colors and motion are perfect.  There''s only one thing I think can be improved--the areas on the left which are overexposed/white.  I think you could try a crop or just fix them directly.  It might be easier to crop, since it''s harder to fix effects like this achieved so naturally in photoshop.  <br/> <br/>GREAT WORK!  Into my favs.</td>', 'I can''t believe I didn''t comment on this (I did vote on this challenge, and this one got a 9 from me).  It''s simply wonderful.  Colors and motion are perfect.  There''s only one thing I think can be improved--the areas on the left which are overexposed/white.  I think you could try a crop or just fix them directly.  It might be easier to crop, since it''s harder to fix effects like this achieved so naturally in photoshop.   GREAT WORK!  Into my favs.', '2006-04-08 02:17:15.000000', NULL, 0),
